#
# Every line below maps a historical alias (old machine hostnames, past
# employer emails, GitHub web-UI identities) to that canonical identity, so
# `git shortlog`, `git blame`, `git log --use-mailmap`, and the GitHub
# contributor graph all show a single author. The platform repos (zdots /
# vdots / adots) had these aliases removed from history directly via
# git-filter-repo in 2026-09; this file is the durable record and a guard
# against future strays.
#
# `dependabot[bot]` is deliberately NOT mapped — it is real automation, a
# distinct actor, not an alias.

